WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,060
You don’t know what the crime of stealing is?

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:04,940
Ah Tian, how do you deal with it?

3
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:06,640
Follow the rules of opposition

4
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:11,180
In case of loss of materials, compensation must be paid first.

5
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:12,340
Delivery of public goods tomorrow morning

6
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:14,060
The compensation should not be less than one point

7
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:16,500
These are terrible

8
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:18,970
Boss, it took me a whole day to get it done.

9
00:00:20,220 --> 00:00:22,260
Ah Tian, let’s come early tomorrow

10
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:24,380
I'll also come early in the morning to help you look at the materials.

11
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:27,080
thank you all

12
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:33,140
Is the material loss big?

13
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:35,020
Fortunately, most of them are there

14
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,200
Tomorrow morning I will send someone to the public house

15
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:40,680
I support you in building a house.

16
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:43,340
Thank you Captain Wang

17
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:47,240
Everyone in the village is asleep

18
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:59,350
It's a good time for Jinshan to collect Feilong Weimei
